  "implementation": [
    "The single-stage worker entry point now calls the same prefill forward/commit and decode prepare/forward/accept/commit APIs.",
    "Static target verification forwards and returns PP activations; a stage without logits skips logit adjustment and cannot perform local acceptance.",
    "Commit uses final-stage acceptance with each stage's own verify window; raw capture and accepted capture retain their existing ordering.",
    "One outstanding step owns live batch and graph buffers. Failed preparation/forward/acceptance/commit prevents reuse; stale, duplicate and foreign calls are rejected.",
    "Prefill waits for its matching result and final sample before projecting draft context. Local acceptance attempts cannot be overwritten.",
    "Restore temporary CPU verify lengths even if preparation raises; preserve existing hidden-input compact graph epilogues.",
    "No PP scheduler loop, serving capability gate, Mooncake object format or storage API changed."
  ],
